        rate\",\"longDescription\":\"The deposit rate is the rate of interest banks
        receive when they deposit funds in their accounts at the Riksbank overnight
        and is always 0.75 percentage points lower than the policy rate. The deposit
        rate is the floor of what is known as the interest rate corridor and is one
        of the Riksbank's three key rates.\",\"groupId\":2,\"observationMaxDate\":\"2026-08-13\",\"observationMinDate\":\"1994-06-01\",\"seriesClosed\":false},{\"seriesId\":\"SECBLENDEFF\",\"source\":\"Sveriges
