        percentage points higher than the policy rate. The lending rate is known as
        the ceiling of the interest rate corridor and is one of the Riksbank's three
        key rates.\",\"groupId\":2,\"observationMaxDate\":\"2026-08-13\",\"observationMinDate\":\"1994-06-01\",\"seriesClosed\":false},{\"seriesId\":\"SECBLIKVEFF\",\"source\":\"Sveriges
